ّيشَةِ</span> : badminton","<span class=\"arab\">كُرَةُ الطَّاوِلَةِ</span> : ping pong","<span class=\"arab\">كُرَةُ الْيَدِ</span> : bola baling","<span class=\"arab\">كُرَةُ السَّلَّةِ</span> : bola keranjang","<span class=\"arab\">كُرَةُ الطَّائِرَةِ</span> : bola tampar","<span class=\"arab\">الْمُصَارَعَةُ</span> : gusti","<span class=\"arab\">رُكُوبُ الْخَيْلِ</span> : menunggang kuda","<span class=\"arab\">الْهُوكِي</span> : hoki","<span class=\"arab\">الْقَفْزُ الطَّوِيلُ</span> : lompat jauh","<span class=\"arab\">الشِّطْرَنْجُ</span> : catur","<span class=\"arab\">السِّبَاحَةُ</span> : berenang","<span class=\"arab\">الرِّمَايَةُ</span> : memanah","<span class=\"arab\">رَمْيُ الْأَثْقَالِ</span> : lontar peluru","<span class=\"arab\">الْجَرْيُ</span> : lari","<span class=\"arab\">الْجُودُو</span> : judo"]},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh ayat"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">أُحِبُّ كُرَةَ الْقَدَمِ</span> : Saya suka bola sepak.","<span class=\"arab\">أَيَّ رِيَاضَةٍ تُحِبُّ؟</span> : Sukan apa yang kamu suka?"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Nabi Muhammad SAW menggalakkan berenang, memanah dan menunggang kuda."}],"glosari":[["Sukan","<span class=\"arab\">رِيَاضَةٌ</span>"],["Bola","<span class=\"arab\">كُرَةٌ</span>"],["Saya suka","<span class=\"arab\">أُحِبُّ</span>"]]},{"id":"t2-arab-kafa-4","nama":"Pakaian","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pakaian"},{"j":"p","t":"Kita belajar nama-nama pakaian dalam bahasa Arab. Kita memakai pakaian yang bersih dan menutup aurat."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">سِرْوَالٌ</span> : seluar","<span class=\"arab\">قَلَنْسُوَةٌ</span> : songkok","<span class=\"arab\">حِذَاءٌ</span> : kasut","<span class=\"arab\">جَوْرَبٌ</span> : stoking","<span class=\"arab\">إِزَارٌ</span> : kain sarung","<span class=\"arab\">حِزَامٌ</span> : tali pinggang","<span class=\"arab\">مِنْشَفَةٌ</span> : tuala","<span class=\"arab\">قُمَاشٌ</span> : kain","<span class=\"arab\">نَعْلٌ</span> : selipar","<span class=\"arab\">عِمَامَةٌ</span> : serban